Spec: Payment

Purpose:
  Tələbə ödənişlərini müəllimlə kurs arasında escrow məntiqi ilə idarə edir:
  ödənişi tutur, kurs tamamlanana qədər saxlayır, tamamlandıqda müəllimə
  buraxır (bax cases.sdd -> Spec: EscrowCalculation).

Owns:
  BE: ./backend/payment
  FE: ./frontend/payment
  MD: ./mobile/payment
  QA: ./qa/payment
  DO: ./devops (shared infra, no dedicated payment-only stage yet)

Architecture:
  ModularMonolith

Flow:
  @flow

Database:
  @db

API:
  @api

Cases:
  @cases

DependsOn:
  Course   (course completion triggers escrow release)
  User     (payer/payee identity)

UsedBy:
  (none internal yet — top-level feature)

Produces:
  PaymentCompleted event   (see api.sdd -> Services: PaymentService)

ConsumedBy:
  PaymentGateway   (external, see project/integrations.sdd)

State:
  ~

Rules:
  Module-specific knowledge MUST remain inside this directory.
  Source code MUST be resolved through Owns.
  Flow MUST be resolved through @flow.
  Database information MUST be resolved through @db.
  API information MUST be resolved through @api.
  Business/test cases MUST be resolved through @cases.

Note:
  @flow / @db / @api / @cases are references to the sibling files in this
  folder (flow.sdd, db.sdd, api.sdd, cases.sdd). AI opens them only when the
  current stage actually needs them — the module-inheritance / lazy-load
  pattern from prompt/new/9.md. This file follows the universal <module>.sdd
  template finalized in prompt/new/13.md (STEP 3).
